  "post_content": "<p>(19 fotos) Un joven de Onda de 23 a&ntilde;os sali&oacute; totalmente ileso de un espectacular accidente en el que empotr&oacute; el coche que conduc&iacute;a contra un olivo en mitad de una rotonda de la carretera CV-20, la anterior al Apeadero de Betx&iacute;, junto a Struker, Valentia y Carceller. Seg&uacute;n ha indicado, se ha dormido unos segundos cuando iba a trabajar a Vila-real, poco antes de las 8.30 horas de este jueves, en el veh&iacute;culo que le hab&iacute;a prestado un amigo.</p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentsenseferitglorietacv20struker/p1590131.jpg\" alt=\"p1590131\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentsenseferitglorietacv20struker/p1590134.jpg\" alt=\"p1590134\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentsenseferitglorietacv20struker/p1590135.jpg\" alt=\"p1590135\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentsenseferitglorietacv20struker/p1590136.jpg\" alt=\"p1590136\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentsenseferitglorietacv20struker/p1590138.jpg\" alt=\"p1590138\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentsenseferitglorietacv20struker/p1590139.jpg\" alt=\"p1590139\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentsenseferitglorietacv20struker/p1590140.jpg\" alt=\"p1590140\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentsenseferitglorietacv20struker/p1590141.jpg\" alt=\"p1590141\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://p